{'symbol': 'MET', 'date': '2023-03-10 08:00:00', 'title': 'METLIFE INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT ORIGINATES $15.1 BILLION IN PRIVATE PLACEMENT DEBT AND PRIVATE STRUCTURED CREDIT IN 2022', 'text': "WHIPPANY, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--METLIFE INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT (MIM), THE INSTITUTIONAL ASSET MANAGEMENT BUSINESS OF METLIFE, INC. (NYSE: MET), TODAY ANNOUNCED IT ORIGINATED $15.1 BILLION IN PRIVATE PLACEMENT DEBT AND PRIVATE STRUCTURED CREDIT ACROSS 245 TRANSACTIONS IN 2022. THIS INCLUDED $4.1 BILLION OF INVESTMENTS ORIGINATED ON BEHALF OF UNAFFILIATED INSTITUTIONAL CLIENTS. MIM'S TOTAL PRIVATE PLACEMENT ASSETS UNDER MANAGEMENT STOOD AT $89.5 BILLION AS OF DECEMBER 31, 2022."}